5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hello everyone! I'm Rin. I'm really excited to start this adventure with you all!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Toshio,,Greetings. I am Toshio. I will observe the situation carefully before acting.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Hello. I am Mizuki. Let's proceed logically and find the truth together.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
