18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,I will keep my thoughts to myself for now.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,Fine. Let's see who blinks first.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
